es from saltheap cannons. Those who survive tend to go to even more extreme lengths to satisfy their thirst for danger.","abilities":["Movement Speed increases briefly when crossing a Rope Bridge or launched by a <Saltheap Cannon>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":420,"def":60,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"bridge_holder":{"slug":"bridge_holder","name":"Bridge Holder","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bridge Holder.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Portable and quick to build, rope bridges are a convenient way to connect two salt ships. These experienced bridge holders have steady hands, but have not figured out how to fix the structural defects of the bridge.","abilities":["Invisible","Builds rope bridges that allow units to cross"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":720,"def":300,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"saltfin_breaker":{"slug":"saltfin_breaker","name":"Saltfin Breaker","icon":"/enemies-icons/Saltfin Breaker.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Despite its size and weight, this saltfin is surprisingly lithe when swimming through the salts. Normally gentle in nature, it can shatter even hardened ancient salt layers with its powerful slamming attacks when provoked.","abilities":["Attacks deal Physical splash damage to all nearby allied units","Immune to the effects of Salt Flat and gains increased Movement Speed while in Salt Flat"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":2000,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":6}},"explosion_devotee":{"slug":"explosion_devotee","n